{"route":{"id":"38725","name":"Ronda del Ter","intro":"Descobrint el riu Ter al seu pas per Girona Aquest itinerari permet <strong>conèixer els usos ecològics i productius de l’aigua </strong>(fàbriques, balneari), així com el seu<strong> llegat històric</strong>, al llarg del recorregut fluvial de Ter al seu pas per Girona. Al llarg de l’itinerari <strong>es pot trobar un ric patrimoni de fauna i flora,</strong> de deveses, de mecanismes per preservar la biodiversitat (com les rampes) i fer front a crescudes del riu i a les inundacions consegüents.","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Mitjana","durada":"3 hores 45 minuts","desnivell":"85.00 meters","distancia":"18.20 km","tema":"Rius i llacs","imgs":["n38725_1.jpg","n38725_2.jpg","n38725_3.jpg","n38725_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-girona/ronda-del-ter","track":[[41.98968,2.82265],[41.98951,2.82286],[41.98953,2.82311],[41.98954,2.82339],[41.98959,2.82362],[41.9897,2.82359],[41.9899,2.82359],[41.99011,2.82361],[41.99032,2.82364],[41.99053,2.82368],[41.99071,2.82376],[41.99089,2.82385],[41.99106,2.82396],[41.9912,2.82416],[41.99135,2.82441],[41.99145,2.82468],[41.99162,2.8249],[41.99179,2.82503],[41.99198,2.82519],[41.99218,2.82533],[41.99235,2.82547],[41.99255,2.82559],[41.99275,2.82572],[41.99296,2.82579],[41.99317,2.82587],[41.99339,2.82585],[41.99358,2.82582],[41.99377,2.82581],[41.99397,2.82575],[41.99416,2.82572],[41.99439,2.82565],[41.99459,2.82559],[41.99479,2.82556],[41.995,2.82552],[41.99523,2.82542],[41.99541,2.82532],[41.99563,2.82524],[41.99583,2.82511],[41.99604,2.82501],[41.99626,2.82487],[41.99646,2.82478],[41.99667,2.82469],[41.99692,2.82461],[41.99716,2.82454],[41.9974,2.82444],[41.99756,2.82439],[41.99776,2.82443],[41.99802,2.82445],[41.99829,2.82446],[41.99852,2.82443],[41.99873,2.8244],[41.99896,2.8244],[41.99919,2.82439],[41.99942,2.82438],[41.99967,2.82438],[41.99992,2.82438],[42.00016,2.82438],[42.00042,2.8